msgid "调度、执行与同步"
msgstr "Scheduling, execution, and synchronization"

msgid "调度"
msgstr "Scheduling"

msgid ""
"EEVDF 公平任务使用增强红黑树组织选择状态；CPU 所有权、任务交接与 统计在既有调度锁和执行事务边界内管理。各 CPU 用 ACPI PM "
"时钟校准 250 Hz LAPIC 抢占，失败有明确计数回退，回退不保证实际频率。BSP 也使用 本地抢占时钟；只有 100 Hz PIT 推进全局 "
"tick、压力重试和 USER_HZ 统计， 本地抢占和 IPI 不制造额外墙钟时间。对外 CPU 时间仍以统一 USER_HZ 结算，精度 10 "
"ms。 保持已有等待、迁移、信号和离线语义，不能从优化吞吐推导输入延迟必然改善。"
msgstr ""
"EEVDF fair tasks use an augmented red-black tree to organize selection "
"state; CPU ownership, task handoff, and accounting are managed within the "
"existing scheduler locks and execution-transaction boundaries. Each CPU "
"calibrates 250 Hz LAPIC preemption against the ACPI PM clock, with an "
"explicit counter-based fallback on failure; the fallback does not guarantee "
"the actual frequency. The BSP also uses a local preemption clock; only the "
"100 Hz PIT advances global ticks, pressure retries, and USER_HZ accounting, "
"while local preemption and IPIs create no additional wall-clock time. "
"Externally visible CPU time is still accounted uniformly in USER_HZ, with 10"
" ms precision. Existing waiting, migration, signal, and offline semantics "
"are preserved; improved throughput does not imply improved input latency."

msgid ""
"内部公平运行时间优先累计各 CPU 共用的 ACPI PM 计数，保留小数余量并 延伸 24/32 位回绕，避免 PIT IRQ 延迟后旧 uptime"
" 插值停止增长而漏计运行时间。 源不可用时回退旧 uptime，源切换不使公平时钟倒退。这不是用户时钟源； "
"正常调度采样须在一次硬件回绕内，不对长时间暂停后的绝对时间作保证。"
msgstr ""
"Internal fair runtime preferentially accumulates the ACPI PM counter shared "
"by all CPUs, retaining fractional remainders and extending 24/32-bit "
"wraparound. This avoids losing runtime when delayed PIT IRQs cause the old "
"uptime interpolation to stop advancing. If the source is unavailable, it "
"falls back to the old uptime; switching sources does not move the fair clock"
" backward. This is not a userspace clock source; normal scheduling samples "
"must occur within one hardware wraparound, and absolute time after a long "
"pause is not guaranteed."

msgid ""
"发布可运行任务时，调度器设置各在线 CPU 的重新调度标志，并通过独立的 LAPIC 向量唤醒远端 CPU；同一未处理标志只发送一次 IPI。自 "
"CPU、离线 CPU 及 SMP 启动交接完成前不发送。IPI 只确认本地 APIC，用户帧进入正常的 "
"调度检查；内核帧继续执行，到原有安全检查点再切换，不抢占持锁内核代码。 任务的 CPU 预留、亲和性、停止状态和 EEVDF 权重保持原有规则。"
msgstr ""
"When publishing a runnable task, the scheduler sets the rescheduling flag on"
" each online CPU and wakes remote CPUs through a dedicated LAPIC vector; "
"only one IPI is sent for the same unhandled flag. No IPI is sent to the "
"current CPU, an offline CPU, or before SMP startup handoff completes. The "
"IPI only acknowledges the local APIC: user frames enter the normal "
"scheduling check, while kernel frames continue until an existing safe "
"checkpoint, without preempting kernel code that holds locks. Task CPU "
"reservations, affinity, stopped state, and EEVDF weights retain their "
"existing rules."

msgid ""
"``setpriority(PRIO_PROCESS, tid, nice)`` 允许有效 UID 与目标真实/有效 UID "
"相同的调用者降低目标的调度优先级，因此用户态 ``renice`` 子进程可以把 同属主的父进程从 nice=-10 恢复到 "
"0。提高优先级或修改其他属主需要 ``CAP_SYS_NICE``；仅有 uid=0 不绕过 capability 检查。值钳制到 -20..19， "
"目标缺失返回 ESRCH，内核 ``getpriority`` 保持 Linux 的 20-nice 编码。 这里不新增尚不支持的 "
"PRIO_PGRP、PRIO_USER 或 RLIMIT_NICE 接口。 权限与编码参考 `Linux setpriority(2) "
"<https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/setpriority.2.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"``setpriority(PRIO_PROCESS, tid, nice)`` allows a caller whose effective UID"
" matches the target's real or effective UID to lower the target's scheduling"
" priority, so a userspace ``renice`` child can restore its same-owner parent"
" from nice=-10 to 0. Raising priority or modifying a task owned by someone "
"else requires ``CAP_SYS_NICE``; uid=0 alone does not bypass capability "
"checks. Values are clamped to -20..19, a missing target returns ESRCH, and "
"the kernel ``getpriority`` retains Linux's 20-nice encoding. Unsupported "
"PRIO_PGRP, PRIO_USER, and RLIMIT_NICE interfaces are not added here. For "
"permissions and encoding, see `Linux setpriority(2) "
"<https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/setpriority.2.html>`_."

msgid "停驻与 I/O"
msgstr "Parking and I/O"

msgid ""
"符合条件的 syscall 返回在原有执行事务完成；pselect 临时信号掩码跨内部 停驻保留。向量 I/O "
"直接调用共享读写后端，保留部分结果、偏移和 retry 状态， 避免递归进入大分发栈帧。等待路径不能把仍被 CPU 使用的任务误认为已交接。 "
"锁开销、临界区与资源生命周期必须一起验证，不通过跳过真实同步换取速度。"
msgstr ""
"Eligible syscall returns complete within the original execution transaction;"
" the temporary pselect signal mask is preserved across internal parking. "
"Vector I/O calls the shared read/write backend directly, retaining partial "
"results, offsets, and retry state and avoiding recursive entry into a large "
"dispatch stack frame. Waiting paths must not mistake a task still in use by "
"a CPU for one already handed off. Lock overhead, critical sections, and "
"resource lifecycles must be validated together; real synchronization must "
"not be skipped for speed."

msgid ""
"无需 I/O 的私有 demand-zero、COW 和只读可执行页缓存命中，在读 gate 或 排队后的写 gate "
"内解决后，均通过既有用户返回检查决定是否继续当前任务； 不再因为 gate 类型或缓存命中本身强制让出 CPU。待处理信号、抢占标志、 "
"亲和性、任务/CPU 所有权和帧检查仍可拒绝直接返回。共享 MM、实际文件页入、 回收和错误路径保留原有串行化及调度检查点。"
msgstr ""
"Private demand-zero faults, COW, and read-only executable page-cache hits "
"requiring no I/O, once resolved within a read gate or a queued write gate, "
"all use the existing user-return checks to decide whether to continue the "
"current task; the gate type or cache hit itself no longer forces a CPU "
"yield. Pending signals, preemption flags, affinity, task/CPU ownership, and "
"frame checks can still reject direct return. Shared MM, actual file page-in,"
" reclamation, and error paths retain their original serialization and "
"scheduling checkpoints."

msgid ""
"普通文件读写、目录枚举和文件间传输沿用 2 ms 工作预算，在完整后端操作 完成后保存进度、释放所有权并通过原有内部重试路径继续。预算改用 "
"``time_work_counter_us()``：校准可用时读取当前 CPU 的 TSC，避免 IRQ 延迟时 旧 uptime 插值到一个 "
"tick 后停止增长。该计数只在一次不迁移、不睡眠的 调用内相减；未校准时回退旧 uptime。它不向用户公开，不改变 "
"``clock_gettime``、vDSO、USER_HZ 或任务公平时间；单次后端操作仍可能超过 预算，因此这不是整段 syscall "
"或输入响应的硬实时上限。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary file reads/writes, directory enumeration, and file-to-file "
"transfers retain a 2 ms work budget: after a complete backend operation, "
"they save progress, release ownership, and continue through the existing "
"internal retry path. The budget now uses ``time_work_counter_us()``: when "
"calibration is available, it reads the current CPU's TSC, avoiding the old "
"uptime interpolation stopping after one tick when IRQs are delayed. Counter "
"differences are taken only within a single non-migrating, non-sleeping call;"
" without calibration it falls back to the old uptime. It is not exposed to "
"userspace and does not change ``clock_gettime``, vDSO, USER_HZ, or task fair"
" time; a single backend operation can still exceed the budget, so this is "
"not a hard real-time bound on an entire syscall or input response."

msgid "管道数据事务"
msgstr "Pipe data transactions"

msgid ""
"已准备好的匿名管道标量读写可使用执行读事务。读事务保留任务、描述符、 OFD、管道和地址空间的生命周期，各管道自己的数据锁保护读写位置和完整 "
"记录的复制，因此不同管道可并行处理，同一管道的小写入仍保持原子性。 关闭、描述符替换、端点计数、扩容及回收继续使用独占执行事务；已有写事务 "
"排队时拒绝新的读事务，保持这些操作的进展。"
msgstr ""
"Prepared scalar reads/writes on anonymous pipes can use execution read "
"transactions. The read transaction retains the lifetimes of the task, "
"descriptor, OFD, pipe, and address space, while each pipe's data lock "
"protects read/write positions and copying of complete records. Different "
"pipes can therefore be processed in parallel, while small writes to the same"
" pipe remain atomic. Close, descriptor replacement, endpoint accounting, "
"expansion, and reclamation continue to use exclusive execution transactions;"
" new read transactions are rejected when a write transaction is already "
"queued, ensuring progress for those operations."

msgid ""
"该路径只接纳没有共享 MM、没有在途续调且缓冲区已驻留的用户任务。 复制前检查全部页面；输出还要求各级页表及叶项具有真实硬件写权限。 "
"缺页、COW、共享文件首次写入通知和设备映射不在数据锁内处理，统一回到 完整路径。命名管道及带路径的描述符保留原来的 inode 通知，跟踪中的任务 "
"也走完整分发。每次复制仍最多 32 KiB，不改变 ``PIPE_BUF``、容量或 大请求短读写语义。"
msgstr ""
"This path admits only user tasks with no shared MM, no in-flight "
"continuation, and resident buffers. All pages are checked before copying; "
"output also requires actual hardware write permission at every page-table "
"level and leaf entry. Page faults, COW, first-write notification for shared "
"files, and device mappings are not handled under the data lock and instead "
"return to the full path. Named pipes and descriptors with paths retain their"
" original inode notifications, and traced tasks also use full dispatch. Each"
" copy remains limited to 32 KiB; ``PIPE_BUF``, capacity, and short "
"read/write semantics for large requests do not change."

msgid ""
"数据锁在唤醒等待队列、通知 poll 或检查调度之前释放。阻塞等待和 ``SIGPIPE`` 继续由独占路径处理；检查条件与登记睡眠之间不会插入并行 "
"数据修改。已完成的调用更新原有进程 I/O 统计，并用同一用户返回检查处理 待处理信号、CPU 亲和性和重新调度请求。"
msgstr ""
"The data lock is released before waking wait queues, notifying poll, or "
"checking scheduling. Blocking waits and ``SIGPIPE`` remain handled by the "
"exclusive path; no concurrent data modification can occur between checking "
"the condition and registering sleep. Completed calls update existing process"
" I/O statistics and use the same user-return checks for pending signals, CPU"
" affinity, and rescheduling requests."

msgid ""
"``tools/test_pipe_parallel.py`` 检查独立管道进展、多写者记录、生命周期 写事务排斥和不可直接复制页面的回退；原生探针 "
"``tools/tests/pipe_parallel_runtime_probe.c`` 检查真实进程的数据和缺页/COW 结果，``--pty`` "
"可在外部负载期间测量 PTY 递送延迟。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_pipe_parallel.py`` checks progress on independent pipes, "
"records from multiple writers, exclusion by lifecycle write transactions, "
"and fallback for pages that cannot be copied directly. The native probe "
"``tools/tests/pipe_parallel_runtime_probe.c`` checks data and page-fault/COW"
" results in real processes; ``--pty`` can measure PTY delivery latency under"
" external load."

msgid "私有页故障与执行事务"
msgstr "Private page faults and execution transactions"

msgid ""
"执行读事务只接纳没有共享 MM 的用户任务：私有匿名缺页、已映射的可写 私有 COW 页以及已在页缓存中的可执行映像只读文件页可以并行处理。COW "
"沿用原有复制和物理页引用规则，也适用于符合条件的私有文件映射；初次 文件页装入走缓存快速路径时，VMA 必须持有 "
"``exec_source``，其来源保留 路径、提供者及 inode 引用，并禁止对该文件写入。缓存命中在缓存锁内取得 "
"页引用，映射失败时归还；文件偏移、段尾、EOF 和执行权限沿用慢路径的规则。 读事务不调用文件系统、设备或来源生命周期回调，也不执行用户复制或调度。"
msgstr ""
"Execution read transactions admit only user tasks without shared MM: private"
" anonymous faults, already-mapped writable private COW pages, and read-only "
"executable-image file pages already in the page cache can be handled in "
"parallel. COW retains the existing copying and physical-page reference rules"
" and also applies to eligible private file mappings. For initial file page-"
"in through the cache fast path, the VMA must hold an ``exec_source`` that "
"retains path, provider, and inode references and prohibits writes to that "
"file. Cache hits take a page reference under the cache lock and return it if"
" mapping fails; file offsets, segment ends, EOF, and execution permissions "
"follow the slow-path rules. Read transactions do not call filesystem, "
"device, or source-lifecycle callbacks and do not perform user copies or "
"scheduling."

msgid ""
"共享 MM（包括 ``CLONE_VM`` 和 ``vfork``）、共享/设备映射仍走原来的独占故障 "
"路径。不符合上述缓存条件的初次文件页装入（包括可写文件和 tmpfs）、缓存 未命中及不符合段尾条件的页也使用独占路径；已经存在的合格私有 COW 页 "
"仍可按上述无 I/O 分支处理。内核态用户复制故障保留可重入的写事务。 读事务因已有写者排队而被拒绝时，任务按 FIFO 获得写事务后先尝试同一批 无 "
"I/O 的私有工作。上述任一私有工作解决后，在 IRQ 关闭且持有执行事务时 使用正常的用户返回谓词检查任务、信号、调度请求、CPU 亲和性和帧；检查 "
"通过才直接恢复，不因读/写 gate、COW 或缓存命中本身强制重新选择任务。 "
"检查拒绝时先释放事务再调度。其他故障保留原有调度行为，定时器仍可正常抢占。"
msgstr ""
"Shared MM (including ``CLONE_VM`` and ``vfork``) and shared/device mappings "
"still use the original exclusive fault path. Initial file page-in that does "
"not meet the cache conditions above (including writable files and tmpfs), "
"cache misses, and pages that do not meet segment-end conditions also use the"
" exclusive path; existing eligible private COW pages can still use the "
"no-I/O branch above. Kernel-mode user-copy faults retain a reentrant write "
"transaction. When a read transaction is rejected because a writer is already"
" queued, the task first tries the same set of no-I/O private operations "
"after obtaining the write transaction in FIFO order. Once any of these "
"private operations is resolved, the normal user-return predicate checks the "
"task, signals, scheduling requests, CPU affinity, and frame with IRQs "
"disabled and the execution transaction held; direct resumption occurs only "
"if checks pass, without forcing task reselection merely because of a "
"read/write gate, COW, or a cache hit. If rejected, the transaction is "
"released before scheduling. Other faults retain their existing scheduling "
"behavior, and timer preemption remains available."

msgid ""
"全局页表变更序号使用原子递增和读取，映射更新在发布序号之前完成。 每个 CPU 在载入 CR3 前记录观察到的序号；载入期间出现的新变更会使下次 "
"条件检查时重新载入。该序号仍是全局保守失效机制，不改变页表结构、 跨 CPU shootdown 协议或应用 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"The global page-table change sequence number is incremented and read "
"atomically, and mapping updates complete before the sequence number is "
"published. Each CPU records the observed sequence number before loading CR3;"
" a new change during the load causes another reload at the next conditional "
"check. This remains a global conservative invalidation mechanism and does "
"not change the page-table structure, cross-CPU shootdown protocol, or "
"application ABI."

msgid "执行事务诊断"
msgstr "Execution-transaction diagnostics"

msgid ""
"``CONFIG_LOCK_STAT`` 默认关闭；启用后只构建诊断，启动时采样仍关闭。 "
"配置开启时，``/proc/reliefnt/lock_stats`` 提供 ReliefNT 自有格式， 并非 Linux "
"``/proc/lock_stat`` 的格式或等价实现。该文件权限为 ``0644 root:root``，写入除了文件 DAC "
"检查外还要求当前任务拥有 ``CAP_SYS_ADMIN``。在字节偏移 0 单次写入 ``1`` 开始采样、``0`` "
"停止并保留计数、``reset`` 清空当前窗口；三者均可附一个换行。其他 输入或非零写入偏移返回 ``EINVAL``。零长度截断为无副作用的成功， "
"允许常见 shell 重定向；非零长度截断被拒绝。``O_SYNC`` 和 ``O_DSYNC`` 写入成功后返回已提交的字节数；显式 "
"``fsync`` 仍按 proc 原有语义返回 ``EINVAL``。``writev`` 逐段提交，首段为完整命令时可能返回正的短写， "
"后续片段不会被当作同一条原子命令；需要完整命令时使用一次 ``write``。关闭配置时该节点不存在， proc 的原有只读挂载属性不变；开启配置时 "
"proc 默认挂载为可写以提供 此控制节点，其余生成节点仍拒绝写入和元数据修改。显式只读挂载或 重挂载仍拒绝控制节点写入；一般 proc "
"节点不会因此变成可写文件。"
msgstr ""
"``CONFIG_LOCK_STAT`` is disabled by default; enabling it only builds "
"diagnostics, with sampling still disabled at boot. When configured, "
"``/proc/reliefnt/lock_stats`` provides a ReliefNT-specific format, not "
"Linux's ``/proc/lock_stat`` format or an equivalent implementation. The file"
" has permissions ``0644 root:root``; writes require the current task to have"
" ``CAP_SYS_ADMIN`` in addition to passing file DAC checks. A single write at"
" byte offset 0 of ``1`` starts sampling, ``0`` stops it and retains "
"counters, and ``reset`` clears the current window; each may have one "
"trailing newline. Other input or a nonzero write offset returns ``EINVAL``. "
"Truncation to zero length succeeds without side effects, allowing common "
"shell redirection; nonzero-length truncation is rejected. Successful "
"``O_SYNC`` and ``O_DSYNC`` writes return the committed byte count; explicit "
"``fsync`` still returns ``EINVAL`` under existing proc semantics. ``writev``"
" commits segment by segment and can return a positive short write when the "
"first segment is a complete command; later segments are not treated as part "
"of the same atomic command. Use a single ``write`` when a complete command "
"is required. With the option disabled, this node is absent and proc retains "
"its original read-only mount behavior; with it enabled, proc is mounted "
"writable by default to provide this control node, while other generated "
"nodes still reject writes and metadata changes. Explicit read-only mounts or"
" remounts still reject writes to the control node; ordinary proc nodes do "
"not become writable files."

msgid "格式头部为::"
msgstr "The format header is::"

msgid ""
"其后每个非空 CPU/固定作用域一行，包含 ``cpu``、``scope``、``acquisitions``、 "
"``contentions``、``wait_total``、``wait_max``、``hold_total``、 "
"``hold_max``、``irq_total``、``irq_max``、``clock_errors`` 以及三个 "
"``wait_hist``、``hold_hist``、``irq_hist`` 逗号分隔的 32 桶计数。 桶 0 覆盖 0–1，桶 "
"i（1–30）覆盖 ``2^i`` 至 ``2^(i+1)-1``，桶 31 覆盖不少于 ``2^31`` 周期的所有值，因而高端百分位只能确定下界。 "
"每个计数和累计值达到 ``UINT64_MAX`` 后饱和；最大值不回绕。TSC 倒退 时丢弃对应的间隔并增加 "
"``clock_errors``，不会把无效值算成零延迟。 同一个区间的等待、持锁和中断窗口分别校验，因此一次倒退可产生多个 "
"错误计数。时间采样使用带序列化屏障的原始 x86 TSC 周期，不转换为微秒； 其频率、虚拟机迁移及硬件稳定性决定了可比性。不要将未经校准的周期 "
"当作实时时间，或跨不同频率、不同系统直接比较。"
msgstr ""
"Each subsequent line represents a nonempty CPU/fixed scope and contains "
"``cpu``, ``scope``, ``acquisitions``, ``contentions``, ``wait_total``, "
"``wait_max``, ``hold_total``, ``hold_max``, ``irq_total``, ``irq_max``, "
"``clock_errors``, and three comma-separated 32-bucket counters: "
"``wait_hist``, ``hold_hist``, and ``irq_hist``. Bucket 0 covers 0–1, bucket "
"i (1–30) covers ``2^i`` through ``2^(i+1)-1``, and bucket 31 covers all "
"values of at least ``2^31`` cycles, so only lower bounds can be determined "
"for high-end percentiles. Each counter and total saturates at "
"``UINT64_MAX``; maxima do not wrap. When TSC moves backward, the "
"corresponding interval is discarded and ``clock_errors`` is incremented "
"rather than treating an invalid value as zero latency. Waiting, holding, and"
" interrupt windows in the same interval are validated separately, so one "
"backward step can produce multiple error counts. Time sampling uses raw x86 "
"TSC cycles with serialization barriers, without conversion to microseconds; "
"frequency, VM migration, and hardware stability determine comparability. Do "
"not treat uncalibrated cycles as real time or compare them directly across "
"different frequencies or systems."

msgid ""
"一次成功外层写事务或读事务算一次 acquisition，递归写入口不重复 计数；读尝试失败不生成持有记录。``contentions`` "
"只统计成功写事务 在排队期间实际进入等待循环的次数。所有成功事务均记录从采样起点到 获得所有权的等待窗口，因此无争用事务也包含采样本身的固定开销；这与 "
"Linux lockstat 按锁类与读写状态分类的统计并不相同。持有从获得所有权 附近的采样点开始，到最终释放或 suspend 的采样点结束。IRQ"
" 窗口从 本次 gate 保存并屏蔽中断之后的采样点开始，到恢复中断之前的采样点 结束，包含等待和持有，但不覆盖采样点外的指令；调用者原本已经关中断 "
"时也会记录这个重叠窗口。它既不是全系统所有 ``cli/sti`` 区间，也不 等于所有 IRQ 延迟，多个 CPU "
"的窗口总和不是墙钟时间。启用采样本身会 增加持有和关中断成本，测量时必须和关闭采样的对照组一起报告。"
msgstr ""
"One successful outermost write or read transaction counts as one "
"acquisition; recursive write entries are not counted again, and failed read "
"attempts create no hold record. ``contentions`` counts only successful write"
" transactions that actually enter the wait loop while queued. All successful"
" transactions record the wait window from the sampling start to ownership "
"acquisition, so even uncontended transactions include the fixed overhead of "
"sampling itself; this differs from Linux lockstat's classification by lock "
"class and read/write state. Holding begins at the sample near ownership "
"acquisition and ends at the sample at final release or suspend. The IRQ "
"window begins at the sample after this gate saves and masks interrupts and "
"ends at the sample before restoring them; it includes waiting and holding "
"but not instructions outside the sampling points. This overlapping window is"
" recorded even if the caller already had interrupts disabled. It covers "
"neither all system-wide ``cli/sti`` intervals nor all IRQ latency, and "
"summing windows across CPUs does not give wall-clock time. Sampling itself "
"adds holding and interrupt-disabled overhead; measurements must be reported "
"alongside a control with sampling disabled."

msgid ""
"``generic`` 是未明确分类的 gate 入口；``fault`` 是外层页故障， ``sched`` "
"包含任务选择、空闲维护重新进入和明确标记的资源清理；``syscall_io`` 包含常见文件 打开、关闭、读写（包括定位和向量 "
"I/O）、stat、目录、路径、属性、 同步及挂载调用，``syscall_process`` 包含进程创建、退出、等待、 exec 和 "
"futex，``syscall_memory`` 包含映射、保护及内存管理，其他 syscall 归 "
"``syscall_other``。这些是入口分类，并非调用内每个子操作的 独立计时；例如入口的网络、设备、回收和输入维护仍计入该次 syscall。 "
"嵌套页故障也保留外层作用域。suspend 在释放 gate 时结束持有窗口， 不计算等待或睡眠时间；resume 在实际恢复 CPU 上开始独立的 "
"``resumed`` 事务，不继承睡前作用域，也不跨 CPU 相减 TSC。此选择保留现有模块可见 suspend token 布局。"
msgstr ""
"``generic`` covers gate entries without an explicit classification; "
"``fault`` covers outermost page faults; ``sched`` includes task selection, "
"reentry for idle maintenance, and explicitly marked resource cleanup. "
"``syscall_io`` includes common file open, close, read/write (including "
"positional and vector I/O), stat, directory, path, attribute, "
"synchronization, and mount calls; ``syscall_process`` includes process "
"creation, exit, wait, exec, and futex; ``syscall_memory`` includes mapping, "
"protection, and memory management; other syscalls fall under "
"``syscall_other``. These classify entry points, not independent timings for "
"every suboperation within a call; for example, network, device, reclamation,"
" and input maintenance at entry still count toward that syscall. Nested page"
" faults also retain the outer scope. suspend ends the hold window when "
"releasing the gate, excluding waiting or sleeping time; resume starts an "
"independent ``resumed`` transaction on the CPU actually resuming it, without"
" inheriting the pre-sleep scope or subtracting TSC values across CPUs. This "
"choice preserves the existing module-visible suspend token layout."

msgid ""
"计数按 CPU 和固定作用域保存，不记录内核地址。采样关闭时采样钩子不 新增 CPU 查询或读取 TSC，也不写计数；原有写 gate 为识别 CPU "
"的查询在 不支持 RDPID 的机器上仍可能执行 RDTSCP。``reset`` 使用新 epoch，使先前已开始但尚未提交的采样 "
"不能污染新窗口；关闭/重新开启也使旧持有段失效：已计入的 acquisition 可能没有对应的 持有或 IRQ "
"样本。控制写入在执行事务内串行化；并发快照逐字段读取，不能假定所有 CPU 是同一瞬间。每次 "
"可读取方式打开文件捕获一个固定视图，使同一打开文件的短读、偏移和 重读一致；重新打开才观察新数据，捕获可能因内存不足失败并引入额外开销。仅写入方式 "
"打开不分配该视图，方便在内存不足时停止采样。控制会话与 epoch 在内部代数耗尽时返回 ``EOVERFLOW`` 而不回绕，代数耗尽时仍可停止 "
"已经开启的采样。"
msgstr ""
"Counters are stored per CPU and fixed scope, without recording kernel "
"addresses. When sampling is off, sampling hooks add no CPU queries or TSC "
"reads and write no counters; the existing write-gate CPU-identification "
"query may still execute RDTSCP on machines without RDPID. ``reset`` uses a "
"new epoch so samples already started but not yet committed cannot "
"contaminate the new window; stopping/restarting also invalidates old hold "
"segments, so an acquisition already counted may lack a corresponding hold or"
" IRQ sample. Control writes are serialized within execution transactions; "
"concurrent snapshots read field by field and cannot be assumed to capture "
"all CPUs at one instant. Each readable open captures a fixed view, keeping "
"short reads, offsets, and rereads on the same open file consistent; "
"reopening is required to see new data. Capture can fail due to insufficient "
"memory and adds overhead. A write-only open does not allocate this view, "
"making it easier to stop sampling under memory pressure. Control sessions "
"and epochs return ``EOVERFLOW`` when their internal generation space is "
"exhausted rather than wrapping; sampling already enabled can still be "
"stopped after exhaustion."

msgid ""
"Linux lockstat 的分类和时间口径见 `Linux Lock Statistics "
"<https://docs.kernel.org/locking/lockstat.html>`_；该参考用于理解边界， 不能把本文件标记为 Linux"
" 兼容输出。"
msgstr ""
"For Linux lockstat's classification and timing definitions, see `Linux Lock "
"Statistics <https://docs.kernel.org/locking/lockstat.html>`_; this reference"
" explains the boundaries and does not justify labeling this file as Linux-"
"compatible output."
